  <item>
    <title>EP.03用尽办法寻找，那个无条件接纳自己的地方</title>
    <link>https://www.xiaoyuzhoufm.com/episode/66e41ca95ca6d0ace3b8d54c</link>
    <guid isPermaLink="false">66e41ca95ca6d0ace3b8d54c</guid>
    <pubDate>Fri, 13 Sep 2024 11:06:16 +0000</pubDate>
    <description><![CDATA[<p><strong><span>好久不见，</span></strong></p><span></span><p><span>是今年3月和乔治的一次长谈，最近终于能有时间来剪辑。</span></p><span></span><p><span>我想，过去的3个月里我的心态又发生了一些变化，庆幸的是，记录下了我们天马行空的不知所云。</span></p><span></span><p><span>剪辑的时候我一直在感叹，这一场好大好空的聊天，剪的我有点儿抓耳挠腮，但又很想拥抱乔治。</span></p><span></span><ul><span>  </span><li><span>时间戳</span></li><span></span></ul><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="364">06:04</a> 从ChatGPT到玄学</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="768">12:48</a> 皈依宗教是为了寻找归属感，而不是随波逐流</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="942">15:42</a> 《抓落叶》，心流、永恒之境、死亡，都是为了找一个接纳自己的地方</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="1341">22:21</a> 以死之名，薪火相传，活着就是热爱</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="1588">26:28</a> 死亡是什么：，死与生循环不止</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="1685">28:05</a> 我们都有自己的剧本，注定的命运，但选择是自己的</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="2115">35:15</a> 现生受苦还是活得又爽又长</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="2254">37:34</a> 有求必应，每个人心里都有空洞，永远无法填满</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="2400">40:00</a> 对世界失望实际上是因为如此爱这个世界，生活就是解药</span></p><span></span><ul><span>  </span><li><span>BGM</span></li><span></span></ul><span></span><p><span>Morning-Kevin MacLeod</span></p><span></span><p><span>Sorrow – Neutrin05</span></p><span></span><p><span>I Feel Alive – Alex-Productions</span></p>]]></description>
    <enclosure url="https://media.xyzcdn.net/lphdaHoQBMdpVWtzEYdMQU7gsJSR.m4a" length="46530647" type="audio/mp4"/>
    <itunes:duration>00:47:57</itunes:duration>
    <itunes:image href="https://image.xyzcdn.net/FnrOgAVwX1Eo2-AwwC5OOPhrYiop.png"/>
    <itunes:explicit>false</itunes:explicit>
  </item>
  <item>
    <title>EP.02 热辣滚烫 | 赢了曾经的自己，爱上现在的自己</title>
    <link>https://www.xiaoyuzhoufm.com/episode/6604faf32d9eae5d0a891667</link>
    <guid isPermaLink="false">6604faf32d9eae5d0a891667</guid>
    <pubDate>Thu, 28 Mar 2024 05:06:58 +0000</pubDate>
    <description><![CDATA[<p><strong><span>一个月前和乔治看了《热辣滚烫》，这是我们的（主观）观后感。</span></strong></p><span></span><p><span>聊天的开头是乔治提到和高中同学的一次见面，</span></p><span></span><p><span>同学震惊于她当时不太好的状态，</span></p><span></span><p><span>于是惊呼“你怎么面黄肌胖的”。</span></p><span></span><ul><span>  </span><li><strong><span>时间戳</span></strong></li><span></span></ul><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="44">00:44</a> 一般好看的电影</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="243">04:03</a> 孤注一掷&amp;差不多得了</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="355">05:55</a> 学习阅读自己的《使用指南》</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="701">11:41</a> 你有赢自己吗</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="1035">17:15</a> 活一种感受</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="1182">19:42</a> 与人产生链接前的自我预设</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="1352">22:32</a> 境随心转，心随境转</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="1725">28:45</a> 我们都是讨好型人格</span></p><span></span><ul><span>  </span><li><strong><span>BGM</span></strong></li><span></span></ul><span></span><p><span>Morning-Kevin MacLeod</span></p><span></span><p><span>Sorrow – Neutrin05</span></p><span></span><p><span>I Feel Alive – Alex-Productions</span></p>]]></description>
    <enclosure url="https://media.xyzcdn.net/lstxDAIM7oN2mbLXTAvPecVB8Mr4.m4a" length="29700480" type="audio/mp4"/>
    <itunes:duration>00:30:36</itunes:duration>
    <itunes:image href="https://bts-image.xyzcdn.net/aHR0cHM6Ly9pbWFnZS54eXpjZG4ubmV0L0Zuck9nQVZ3WDFFbzItQXd3QzVPT1Bocllpb3AucG5n.png"/>
