  <item>
    <title>EP.01 人生是旷野？不，我们需要轨道</title>
    <link>https://www.xiaoyuzhoufm.com/episode/65d8b73e3af97665af3af48c</link>
    <guid isPermaLink="false">65d8b73e3af97665af3af48c</guid>
    <pubDate>Tue, 27 Feb 2024 14:00:00 +0000</pubDate>
    <description><![CDATA[<p><span>我们念叨了很久想做播客，但迟迟没有行动。</span></p><span></span><p><span>在今年终于下定决心，要把和乔治聊天的过程记录整理下来。</span></p><span></span><p><span>找的咖啡厅有些嘈杂（努力做降噪了~），聊天的内容五花八门想哪说哪。</span></p><span></span><p><span>希望能记录到我们都有勇气面对离别的那天。</span></p><span></span><ul><span>  </span><li><strong><span>时间戳</span></strong></li><span></span></ul><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="268">04:28</a> 阅读斯伯格，自古诗书不负人</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="543">09:03</a> 人生是旷野？不，我们需要轨道</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="620">10:20</a> 换位思考×主动理解，先有生活，再谈友谊</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="840">14:00</a> 不活在设想中，接受自己的不完美</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="1119">18:39</a> 放下伪装，找找自己的真实想法</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="1320">22:00</a> 共生关系和寄生关系</span></p><span></span><ul><span>  </span><li><strong><span>BGM</span></strong></li><span></span></ul><span></span><p><span>Morning-Kevin MacLeod</span></p><span></span><p><span>Impromptu in Quarter Comma Meantone</span></p><span></span><p><span>Deep Relaxation</span></p>]]></description>
    <enclosure url="https://media.xyzcdn.net/lvV4zpj7UnIH_7N81ywsq8rm7scZ.m4a" length="25581733" type="audio/mp4"/>
    <itunes:duration>00:26:21</itunes:duration>
    <itunes:image href="https://bts-image.xyzcdn.net/aHR0cHM6Ly9pbWFnZS54eXpjZG4ubmV0L0Zuck9nQVZ3WDFFbzItQXd3QzVPT1Bocllpb3AucG5n.png"/>
